  "exact_scope": "For every usc obstacle, the full local-Fubini--Study/semipositive-real-PL regularized envelope is classically psh on products of a perfected-bijective-normalization strict curve with a smooth geometrically connected projective factor, and on analytic projective bundles over such curves. Exact global competitor descent and ordinary projection/regularization compatibility are proved. Concrete normal domains and nonnormal geometrically unibranch cusp products are realized. Explicit continuous-obstacle failures are proved for split branches, codimension-two seminormal point gluings including a single irreducible bidisc with two points pinched, and the irreducible nonsplit quadratic-node surface over Q_3.",
